  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Entry point of the email-driven banking system. Verifies sender (incl. multi-account disambiguation, FR-6.12), branches SUSPENDED accounts to Account Reactivation, strips the password/challenge code before any LLM call (FR-6.7), redacts PII (FR-7.1), classifies intent via Groq, and routes to the correct sub-workflow. Sub-workflows (Transaction Execution, Statement Request, Support/RAG Draft, Account Closure, Account Reactivation, Fraud Monitoring, Standing Order Scheduler, Reconciliation+Age-Trigger, Interest Accrual) must be built and imported separately, then their real workflow IDs pasted into the 'Execute Workflow' node placeholders in this file (search for *_WORKFLOW_ID)."
  },
